# Files Flux should ignore in the source (defense-in-depth alongside kustomization.yaml).
# The kustomization.yaml whitelist is the primary mechanism; kustomize-controller
# only builds from files listed there. This keeps kpt/local-config artifacts out of
# the GitRepository artifact entirely.

# kpt package metadata
Kptfile
**/Kptfile

# kpt local-config / function configs
package-context.yaml
**/package-context.yaml
telemetry-config.yaml
**/telemetry-config.yaml
apply-telemetry.yaml
**/apply-telemetry.yaml

# root-level customization ConfigMap + KRM function configs + schema
app-config.yaml
app-config-schema.yaml
version-config.yaml
setup-*.yaml
validator-*.yaml
replace-*.yaml
branding-image-provider.yaml

# docs / tests / source
README.md
**/README.md
